[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This package contains the sources of the naxsi module only.  It does not
install a loadable module, and installing it alongside nginx does not put
a firewall in front of a running server.

The module itself is built by the nginx ports.  To use it, build
www/nginx, www/nginx-devel or www/freenginx with the NAXSI option
enabled.  Those ports pick the sources up from
%%PREFIX%%/share/nginx/modules/nginx-module-naxsi, link against
devel/libinjection and produce ngx_http_naxsi_module.so.
EOM
}
]
